WEBVTT

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:39.720
It's simply no use.

00:00:40.550 --> 00:00:43.850
My crest has no room left to grow.

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:49.860
<i>The first crest, my crest, 
specializes in creation.</i>

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:53.180
<i>The second specializes in power.</i>

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:56.990
<i>The third specializes in rapid firing.</i>

00:00:57.780 --> 00:01:00.170
<i>If I want to grow stronger,</i>

00:01:00.170 --> 00:01:04.660
<i>I must acquire the fourth crest, 
the one best suited to combat.</i>

00:01:05.340 --> 00:01:08.630
One's crest appears at birth 
and cannot be changed.

00:01:09.260 --> 00:01:10.430
<i>Which means...</i>

00:01:18.050 --> 00:01:22.970
<b>The Strongest Sage with the Weakest Crest</b>

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:27.980
<b>Episode 1</b>

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:27.980
<b>The Strongest Sage Appears.</b>

00:01:37.850 --> 00:01:40.790
We'll be reaching the capital soon.

00:01:40.790 --> 00:01:45.330
Impressive that you're leaving home 
and taking exams at age twelve.

00:01:46.510 --> 00:01:49.560
I'm determined to enter the academy 
and become strong.

00:01:49.560 --> 00:01:51.510
It's not safe to go too quickly.

00:01:51.510 --> 00:01:53.910
You might have been a big fish 
where you came from,

00:01:53.910 --> 00:01:55.680
but that crest of yours...

00:01:57.570 --> 00:01:59.280
There's a monster nearby.

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:00.680
It's heading our way.

00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:01.730
Eh?

00:02:01.730 --> 00:02:04.150
It might be a rather large monster.

00:02:04.150 --> 00:02:06.100
Many times bigger than your wagon.

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:08.980
You say the strangest things.

00:02:10.330 --> 00:02:13.700
That would make it 
a calamity-grade monster.

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:24.030
Dispatch successful.

00:02:25.940 --> 00:02:31.000
Easily handled with just Enhance Physique 
and Sunder Steel.

00:02:50.790 --> 00:02:52.870
That's the capital for you...

00:02:52.870 --> 00:02:54.750
Completely unlike my homeland.

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:56.860
My friend's sword broke!

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:59.360
Can you make me one just like it?

00:02:59.800 --> 00:03:02.540
Stop shouting! I hear you just fine!

00:03:02.540 --> 00:03:04.400
I'm sorry.

00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:09.160
But see... She broke her magic sword 
while protecting me from a monster.

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:10.600
Magic sword?

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:12.910
And you want me to remake a magic sword?

00:03:12.910 --> 00:03:15.170
You can't possibly be serious!

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:18.000
Isn't there anything you can do?

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:20.150
I'm afraid you're out of luck.

00:03:20.150 --> 00:03:22.370
<i>These weapons are well made...</i>

00:03:22.370 --> 00:03:24.300
<i>Though the enchantments are poorly applied.</i>

00:03:25.030 --> 00:03:26.490
<i>Are there any other swords?</i>

00:03:26.490 --> 00:03:28.350
It simply can't be done.

00:03:28.610 --> 00:03:30.070
I'm begging you!

00:03:30.070 --> 00:03:32.070
The entrance exams are tomorrow!

00:03:32.070 --> 00:03:33.880
If I don't get her a sword, she'll—

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:37.520
If you need it that fast, 
you might have better luck elsewhere.

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:41.170
It's not as if I can forge 
a magic sword by myself.

00:03:41.170 --> 00:03:43.110
We've tried everyone else already!

00:03:43.380 --> 00:03:45.500
Would one of our ready-made swords do?

00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:47.080
Hmm...

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:49.240
It should be about this long,

00:03:49.240 --> 00:03:53.200
and light enough that a girl can swing it 
around like this with one hand!

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:58.770
A sword like that 
certainly would have to be enchanted...

00:03:58.770 --> 00:04:01.070
But it won't be easy to make.

00:04:01.070 --> 00:04:02.680
I can handle the enchantment.

00:04:03.600 --> 00:04:05.110
You can?

00:04:05.110 --> 00:04:08.680
Look, kid... 
I get that you want to show off...

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:12.390
But it can't be done, 
and she needs to accept that.

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:17.270
It's true that my fourth crest 
isn't well suited to enchantments.

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:19.880
But I think I can handle 
a basic magic sword.

00:04:19.880 --> 00:04:22.680
Isn't that the Crest of Failure?

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:24.780
All the more impossible, then.

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:26.960
Make me a sword!

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:30.410
One with a setting for a magistone.

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:32.500
Wait, you mean—

00:04:33.440 --> 00:04:35.940
I'm going to put my faith in him.

00:04:35.940 --> 00:04:37.480
A-Are you sure?

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:39.710
If he fails, the sword will be fine,

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:41.450
but you'll have wasted a magistone.

00:04:41.450 --> 00:04:43.990
I still think he can do it.

00:04:43.990 --> 00:04:46.510
I've got good instincts 
about these things!

00:04:48.290 --> 00:04:51.180
Let's get on that enchantment, kid!

00:04:55.510 --> 00:04:58.230
Oh, I forgot to introduce myself.

00:04:58.660 --> 00:05:01.860
I'm Alma. Alma Lepucius.

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:04.520
I didn't want my parents 
marrying me off to some weirdo,

00:05:04.520 --> 00:05:06.240
so I set off on my own!

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:10.650
I'm Matthias. Matthias Hildesheimer.

00:05:10.650 --> 00:05:12.160
You can call me "Matty."

00:05:12.590 --> 00:05:15.370
Sure! It's a pleasure, Matty!

00:05:16.700 --> 00:05:18.760
Oh, right! I've got a friend!

00:05:18.760 --> 00:05:22.470
The sword is hers. 
We left home together!

00:05:22.470 --> 00:05:23.260
Alma?

00:05:24.400 --> 00:05:26.060
Speak of the devil!

00:05:26.060 --> 00:05:26.880
Lurie!

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:29.970
Alma. Did you have any luck 
at this shop?

00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:33.720
<i>Sh-She's beautiful!</i>

00:05:34.170 --> 00:05:36.920
I'm afraid every shop I tried 
turned me down...

00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:39.540
It simply might not be possible 
to make a magic sword by tomo—

00:05:39.540 --> 00:05:41.830
Oh, this guy? He's Matty!

00:05:41.830 --> 00:05:45.870
He said he'd enchant a sword for us!

00:05:45.870 --> 00:05:47.700
A-Allow me to introduce myself!

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:49.710
I am humbly referred to 
as Matthias Hildesheimer!

00:05:49.710 --> 00:05:52.080
Where'd the formality come from?

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:56.730
<i>Was my introduction that off-putting?</i>

00:05:56.730 --> 00:05:59.250
<i>This is what I get 
for never having friends!</i>

00:06:00.480 --> 00:06:01.900
What's wrong, Lurie?

00:06:03.080 --> 00:06:05.970
I-I'm Lurie Abendroth!

00:06:05.970 --> 00:06:07.990
I'm neither engaged 
nor romantically involved.

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:11.470
You may call me "Lurie," if you wish...

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:13.760
"Romantically involved"?

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:16.350
Um... well...

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:21.440
<i>I had no idea it was customary here 
to reveal your relationship status.</i>

00:06:22.710 --> 00:06:24.320
It's all done!

00:06:25.770 --> 00:06:28.050
I'll begin the enchantment.

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:29.960
Could you hand me the magistone?

00:06:30.520 --> 00:06:31.640
You can do it here?

00:06:31.640 --> 00:06:33.450
It won't take that long.

00:06:35.760 --> 00:06:36.570
I'm going to begin.

00:06:36.570 --> 00:06:38.210
P-Please do...

00:06:39.890 --> 00:06:43.400
<i>The only way to make something this long 
and light sturdy enough for live combat</i>

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:45.550
<i>is to add Enhance Fortitude 
and Sunder Steel.</i>

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:51.510
That should do it.

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:52.460
Here, try it.

00:06:52.460 --> 00:06:54.640
That was fast! 
Is it really enchanted?

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:57.470
There's no way he could do it that fast.

00:06:57.470 --> 00:07:00.740
Yeah, isn't it supposed to take way longer?

00:07:00.740 --> 00:07:03.340
And he didn't even recite an incantation!

00:07:04.160 --> 00:07:06.000
Let me try it.

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:08.820
It's easy enough to tell if an enchantment—

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:16.720
The enchantment worked!

00:07:16.720 --> 00:07:18.450
That's crazy sharp!

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:20.270
And it took him just moments...

00:07:20.270 --> 00:07:22.130
What trickery is this?

00:07:22.130 --> 00:07:24.080
It's just a standard enchantment.

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:26.540
That's anything but "standard"!

00:07:26.540 --> 00:07:29.490
Who in the world are you, Matty?

00:07:29.490 --> 00:07:32.930
It shouldn't be possible 
to enchant a sword that quickly.

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:36.770
But the sword has clearly been enchanted,

00:07:36.770 --> 00:07:38.440
and you didn't recite an incantation.

00:07:38.440 --> 00:07:40.020
As I forged that sword myself,

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:42.730
I'd know whether you swapped it out 
with sleight-of-hand.

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:45.870
The only possible conclusion is...

00:07:45.870 --> 00:07:47.160
Gulp!

00:07:47.160 --> 00:07:48.280
Is...?

00:07:52.190 --> 00:07:54.880
You wanna become an enchanter, kid?

00:07:54.880 --> 00:07:56.350
Nope.

00:07:58.440 --> 00:08:01.040
The practical skills exam will now begin.

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:03.160
Fields tested will include 
swordsmanship and casting.

00:08:03.160 --> 00:08:03.960
Yes, sir!

00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:07.220
Matty!

00:08:09.230 --> 00:08:12.100
You're taking entrance exams, too?

00:08:12.100 --> 00:08:13.540
Y-Yes...

00:08:13.540 --> 00:08:16.740
The tactics portion was way too hard!

00:08:16.740 --> 00:08:19.740
I did just fine in every other subject...

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:23.660
Alma, Matty!

00:08:23.660 --> 00:08:26.100
Let's work together to pass the test!

00:08:26.100 --> 00:08:27.000
Sure.

00:08:27.460 --> 00:08:28.480
'Kay...

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:32.350
You're wide open!

00:08:36.340 --> 00:08:38.460
You're doing quite well.

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:41.710
But can you dodge this next one?

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:43.590
S-S-Say what?!

00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:46.340
I surrender!

00:08:46.770 --> 00:08:48.660
Where did you get that sword?

00:08:51.720 --> 00:08:53.840
I did it, Matty!

00:08:53.840 --> 00:08:55.810
Congratulations, Lurie!

00:08:55.810 --> 00:08:57.970
I couldn't have done it 
without that magic sword you made me!

00:08:57.970 --> 00:08:59.380
I-It's nothing, really...

00:08:59.380 --> 00:09:01.890
Next up, Matthias Hildesheimer!

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:04.380
Seems to be my turn.

00:09:04.380 --> 00:09:06.350
Give it your best, Matty!

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:07.730
I will.

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:10.540
Wait, where's the examiner?

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:12.850
Matthias Hildesheimer...

00:09:12.850 --> 00:09:17.120
I hear you're the one 
who enchanted Lurie Abendroth's sword.

00:09:17.120 --> 00:09:19.210
And? Who are you?

00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:21.690
You'll need more than an examiner, then...

00:09:21.690 --> 00:09:23.410
I'll fight you myself.

00:09:23.770 --> 00:09:28.220
I'd like to see 
what your father Castor taught you, as well.

00:09:28.990 --> 00:09:30.380
You know my father?

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:31.780
Yes.

00:09:31.780 --> 00:09:33.570
If you handle yourself 
well enough against me,

00:09:33.570 --> 00:09:36.590
I'll vouch for you to pass, 
regardless of your other test scores.

00:09:36.890 --> 00:09:38.290
Very well.

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:44.350
<i>His stance leaves him wide open.</i>

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:46.560
<i>He thinks he's taking it easy on me.</i>

00:09:47.310 --> 00:09:50.860
<i>That's also why he said, 
"If you handle yourself well enough."</i>

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:53.010
<i>I feel a bit insulted...</i>

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:55.160
<i>This is a test!</i>

00:09:55.160 --> 00:09:58.070
<i>Its purpose is to show them 
what I can do!</i>

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:01.970
What?

00:10:01.970 --> 00:10:04.160
A boy your age, parrying my strike...

00:10:13.770 --> 00:10:15.160
I surrender.

00:10:15.160 --> 00:10:17.550
Captain of the Knights' Order, Guile, lost...

00:10:17.940 --> 00:10:20.220
Wow! Isn't he great, Lurie?

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:21.030
Yes!

00:10:21.030 --> 00:10:24.100
Although it happened so quickly 
I couldn't quite follow!

00:10:25.550 --> 00:10:28.100
Next, we'll conduct the casting exam.

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:30.190
Lurie Abendroth. Step forward!

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:31.200
Yes, sir!

00:10:31.550 --> 00:10:35.480
Please attack all five targets 
with Fire Arrow!

00:10:39.090 --> 00:10:41.550
Magic of flame that dwells within me...

00:10:41.550 --> 00:10:45.180
Pierce my foe in the form of an arrow!

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:49.420
Lurie! Keep it up!

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:51.050
Incanted casting?

00:10:51.690 --> 00:10:55.060
<i>As the name suggests, 
it's a method for casting spells</i>

00:10:55.060 --> 00:10:56.830
<i>through the recitation of particular words.</i>

00:10:56.830 --> 00:10:59.480
<i>Anyone can use it regardless of ability,</i>

00:10:59.480 --> 00:11:03.200
<i>but it offers a poor conversion rate 
on the user's magic power,</i>

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:06.080
<i>and you're vulnerable 
to attacks mid-chant.</i>

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:07.870
<i>They're not ideal for combat.</i>

00:11:07.870 --> 00:11:09.660
<i>I'd thought the practice 
was long dead, but...</i>

00:11:09.660 --> 00:11:11.060
Yes!

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:13.940
That's the Crest of Glory! 
What an elite!

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:16.370
Wish I'd been born 
with the Crest of Glory, too...

00:11:18.040 --> 00:11:19.920
<i>But in this day and age,</i>

00:11:19.920 --> 00:11:22.950
<i>the first crest, which is highly compatible 
with incanted casting,</i>

00:11:22.950 --> 00:11:24.540
<i>is labeled the "Crest of Glory"</i>

00:11:24.540 --> 00:11:27.960
<i>and considered the best crest 
for magical combat.</i>

00:11:28.970 --> 00:11:30.060
<i>Meanwhile...</i>

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:32.680
<i>My fourth crest is...</i>

00:11:34.140 --> 00:11:37.420
Excuse me. 
Is Fire Arrow the only spell allowed?

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:42.050
Not necessarily, 
but it's the most basic spell, so...

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:44.540
You've got the Crest of Failure,

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:47.880
but if you do well in the other subjects, 
you might still pass.

00:11:47.880 --> 00:11:50.230
As long as I destroy the targets, correct?

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:51.790
Well, yes...

00:11:51.790 --> 00:11:55.660
<i>"Crest of Failure" casting 
has extremely limited range.</i>

00:11:55.660 --> 00:11:58.730
<i>I don't think I could even reach a third 
of the way to the target.</i>

00:12:00.260 --> 00:12:03.360
You might want to stand 
a bit farther away, sir.

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:04.300
What?

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:06.160
What's he doing?

00:12:06.160 --> 00:12:08.370
I can assign it limited directionality,

00:12:08.370 --> 00:12:10.200
but it won't be free of collateral damage.

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:14.080
H-How is he casting? 
He didn't recite an incantation!

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:15.960
Could it be... a wordless spell?

00:12:16.240 --> 00:12:18.350
<i>Wordless casting is in decline,</i>

00:12:18.350 --> 00:12:21.470
<i>and the fourth crest is scorned 
as the Crest of Failure.</i>

00:12:21.470 --> 00:12:23.720
<i>That's the status quo in this day and age!</i>

00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:36.500
Oh...

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:39.340
I might have overdone it.

00:12:44.990 --> 00:12:47.240
It fits perfectly.

00:12:49.820 --> 00:12:51.600
Hey, Matty!

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:01.630
<i>She looks beautiful 
in her uniform, too!</i>

00:13:04.950 --> 00:13:06.560
What's up, you two?

00:13:06.560 --> 00:13:08.430
Oh, I just—

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:11.600
Uh, we'd better hurry if we want 
to make the opening ceremony!

00:13:13.420 --> 00:13:16.770
The headmaster will now say a few words.

00:13:18.230 --> 00:13:20.770
I'm Eduard, the headmaster here.

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:23.510
I despise long speeches.

00:13:23.510 --> 00:13:25.920
He's the headmaster?

00:13:23.510 --> 00:13:27.210
As far as I'm concerned, 
formality is for First Academy!

00:13:27.210 --> 00:13:30.430
Here at my Second Academy, 
ability is everything!

00:13:30.430 --> 00:13:34.790
We don't care about lineage or crest 
the way First Academy does!

00:13:35.260 --> 00:13:38.710
Work on those skills, rookies!

00:13:38.710 --> 00:13:39.670
That is all!

00:13:40.030 --> 00:13:42.420
That certainly was short!

00:13:43.600 --> 00:13:45.250
I almost forgot...

00:13:45.250 --> 00:13:47.630
Matthias Hildesheimer.

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:50.610
Drop by my office when this is over.

00:13:53.760 --> 00:13:56.050
<i>Why would the headmaster be calling for me?</i>

00:13:56.050 --> 00:13:58.210
<i>Because I destroyed the grounds 
during the exam?</i>

00:13:58.210 --> 00:14:00.470
<i>Is he going to expel me 
on my first day?!</i>

00:14:00.470 --> 00:14:02.750
<i>But I did use a spell 
to repair the damage...</i>

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:04.610
Come in already, Matthias.

00:14:08.190 --> 00:14:09.340
Yes, sir.

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:16.250
<i>I knew it...
He's—</i>

00:14:16.720 --> 00:14:18.750
Matthias Hildesheimer.

00:14:19.210 --> 00:14:21.960
You defeated the Captain of the Knights' Order 
during your swordsmanship exam,

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:25.960
and effortlessly used wordless spells 
during your casting exam.

00:14:26.390 --> 00:14:28.800
Castor being your father 
explains it somewhat,

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:33.650
but I'm sure there's a deeper reason 
why someone your age is so powerful.

00:14:33.650 --> 00:14:35.880
I won't pry as to why that is.

00:14:35.880 --> 00:14:38.640
But I do want to ask for your aid.

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:40.240
My... aid?

00:14:40.240 --> 00:14:41.290
Yes.

00:14:41.290 --> 00:14:45.020
You saw the other students cast 
incanted spells, didn't you?

00:14:45.020 --> 00:14:45.820
Yes...

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:48.130
Why do they use 
such an inefficient technique?

00:14:48.130 --> 00:14:51.170
Wouldn't wordless spells be better?

00:14:51.620 --> 00:14:53.070
"Inefficient," eh?

00:14:53.880 --> 00:14:55.720
Unfortunately, Matthias,

00:14:55.720 --> 00:14:59.410
wordless spells are a lost casting style.

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:01.920
<i>As I suspected...</i>

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:06.140
I don't know that a single other person 
in this kingdom can still use them.

00:15:06.540 --> 00:15:11.760
I've been hoping to revive wordless spell 
techniques here at Second Academy

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:14.890
and teach them to the students...

00:15:14.890 --> 00:15:16.440
That sounds like a great idea!

00:15:16.440 --> 00:15:18.370
But there's one thing stopping me!

00:15:18.370 --> 00:15:19.250
There is?

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:20.300
Yes.

00:15:20.300 --> 00:15:22.860
Our sister academy here in the capital,

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:25.150
the First Royal Academy.

00:15:26.030 --> 00:15:28.360
The nobility endorses First Academy's teachings,

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:30.150
which have a proven track record.

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:35.030
We've had no choice 
but to follow their curriculum.

00:15:35.340 --> 00:15:37.330
What kind of track record?

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:40.370
First Academy's published research.

00:15:42.310 --> 00:15:44.000
This is their "track record"?

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:46.820
But it talks only about incanted spells...

00:15:46.820 --> 00:15:51.300
Incanted spells are the only form 
of casting accepted in academia.

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:54.260
Wordless spells are rejected.

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:55.800
How do we get them accepted?

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:59.360
We'll have to prove the power 
of wordless casting

00:15:59.790 --> 00:16:03.690
at the next inter-school competition.

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:07.480
And that's the "aid" 
you're asking me for?

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:08.340
Yes.

00:16:08.340 --> 00:16:12.650
I want you to instruct us 
in wordless casting!

00:16:14.380 --> 00:16:15.690
Matthias.

00:16:16.050 --> 00:16:17.330
Can I count on you?

00:16:21.840 --> 00:16:23.140
Very well.

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:28.140
We will now begin the class.

00:16:28.140 --> 00:16:31.000
Today, we'll be learning wordless spells!

00:16:31.000 --> 00:16:32.460
"Wordless spells"?!

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:33.580
Wordless...

00:16:32.460 --> 00:16:34.710
I didn't know there was such a thing.

00:16:33.580 --> 00:16:34.710
Never heard of it...

00:16:34.710 --> 00:16:36.610
Your doubts are understandable.

00:16:36.610 --> 00:16:39.450
That's why we have 
a special guest instructor.

00:16:39.450 --> 00:16:41.450
He'll be teaching you how they work.

00:16:42.110 --> 00:16:45.750
Isn't he the one who passed the
entrance exams at the top of the class?

00:16:45.750 --> 00:16:47.760
Yes, that's our Matty!

00:16:47.760 --> 00:16:49.730
You can't take credit for him, Alma.

00:16:50.040 --> 00:16:55.000
Matthias, could you demonstrate 
how wordless casting works?

00:16:55.000 --> 00:16:56.450
Very well.

00:17:04.400 --> 00:17:06.310
Was that wordless casting?

00:17:06.310 --> 00:17:08.700
Yeah, I didn't hear an incantation.

00:17:08.700 --> 00:17:10.520
He's a Crest of Failure, right?

00:17:10.520 --> 00:17:12.670
You don't think 
he's really a demon, do you?

00:17:12.670 --> 00:17:16.770
Matthias is not the only one 
who can use wordless spells!

00:17:16.770 --> 00:17:17.830
Mr. Gaizal?

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:18.510
Right!

00:17:23.440 --> 00:17:25.900
I'm not particularly good at casting myself,

00:17:25.900 --> 00:17:30.270
but Matthias's teachings have gotten me 
this far in just one day!

00:17:30.690 --> 00:17:33.120
Well, let's get to it!

00:17:33.120 --> 00:17:34.030
Right!

00:17:34.520 --> 00:17:36.860
Matty, I can do it now, too!

00:17:36.860 --> 00:17:38.180
You can?

00:17:38.180 --> 00:17:40.310
Yeah, let me show you!

00:17:44.420 --> 00:17:46.340
How do you like my casting?

00:17:46.340 --> 00:17:48.940
You don't have to imitate 
the way he grunts, too...

00:17:50.320 --> 00:17:52.050
How is it going, Lurie?

00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:55.420
I seem to have the feel for it,

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:57.960
but I can't shake my
incanted casting habits...

00:17:59.580 --> 00:18:02.360
I may have drained the last 
of my magic!

00:18:03.380 --> 00:18:05.710
They're all doing so well.

00:18:05.710 --> 00:18:07.740
When I see how impressive 
wordless spells are,

00:18:07.740 --> 00:18:12.570
I'm forced to wonder 
why we ever stopped using them.

00:18:12.570 --> 00:18:14.300
<i>She's right.</i>

00:18:14.300 --> 00:18:17.570
<i>Why has wordless casting 
gone into decline?</i>

00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:19.140
Matty?

00:18:19.680 --> 00:18:20.800
Oh, I know.

00:18:20.800 --> 00:18:22.560
Hold out your hand, would you?

00:18:22.560 --> 00:18:23.640
All right...

00:18:26.360 --> 00:18:27.890
M-Matty?!

00:18:27.890 --> 00:18:32.900
W-Well, I have to do this 
to transfer my magic to you!

00:18:32.900 --> 00:18:35.500
Y-You can transfer magic?!

00:18:35.500 --> 00:18:36.460
Yes.

00:18:36.460 --> 00:18:39.630
I'm using a spell 
that attunes my magic to a target.

00:18:39.630 --> 00:18:42.180
It's typically used 
for enchantments, of course.

00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:44.790
Enchantments...

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:47.860
I did it!

00:18:47.860 --> 00:18:49.780
I finally did it, Matty!

00:18:49.780 --> 00:18:51.310
That's the way!

00:18:51.310 --> 00:18:55.850
<i>And so I taught wordless casting 
to all the students.</i>

00:18:55.850 --> 00:18:58.400
Let's show 'em 
what Second Academy can do!

00:18:56.120 --> 00:18:58.010
<i>A month passed...</i>

00:18:58.400 --> 00:18:59.710
It's finally time!

00:18:59.710 --> 00:19:03.210
I hope there are 
no magical chosen ones this year...

00:19:03.210 --> 00:19:05.000
"Magical chosen ones"?

00:19:05.000 --> 00:19:07.770
That's what they call leaders 
at First Academy

00:19:07.770 --> 00:19:09.270
with extremely strong casting ability.

00:19:09.270 --> 00:19:11.950
Any year it seems 
Second Academy might win,

00:19:11.950 --> 00:19:14.870
one of these "magical chosen ones" appears.

00:19:14.870 --> 00:19:18.660
I believe the last Captain of the 
Mages' Order was one of them!

00:19:19.290 --> 00:19:21.340
It seems there is one here...

00:19:21.840 --> 00:19:24.800
With roughly ten times my own magic power.

00:19:24.800 --> 00:19:27.040
Ten times your power, Matty?

00:19:27.040 --> 00:19:29.620
That's demon-level power!

00:19:29.620 --> 00:19:30.770
<i>Demon...</i>

00:19:31.190 --> 00:19:34.740
Demons and humans are
natural enemies, aren't they?

00:19:34.740 --> 00:19:36.110
They certainly are!

00:19:36.110 --> 00:19:39.080
Demons are the greatest threat 
to humanity there is!

00:19:39.080 --> 00:19:43.200
Even the court magicians working together 
probably couldn't beat one.

00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:45.300
But why would you ask that?

00:19:45.300 --> 00:19:47.740
Oh, just curious...

00:19:49.320 --> 00:19:51.040
<i>Demons, eh?</i>

00:19:51.680 --> 00:19:53.750
<i>So they've survived into this era...</i>

00:19:54.620 --> 00:19:57.630
Well, looky here! 
A Crest of Failure!

00:19:59.470 --> 00:20:01.930
A Crest of Failure, all by his lonesome!

00:20:01.930 --> 00:20:04.370
Hey, no buddies with you?

00:20:04.370 --> 00:20:07.050
Did they all run away scared?

00:20:07.050 --> 00:20:08.610
Hey, Crest of Failure!

00:20:08.610 --> 00:20:11.480
Cower before the might of Devilis, 
magical chosen one!

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:15.730
Headmaster, I believe Second Academy 
has given up on victory entirely.

00:20:16.060 --> 00:20:18.360
That'll be sixty-five wins in a row for us.

00:20:18.700 --> 00:20:20.620
Please, Matthias!

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:24.320
What, no witty rejoinder?

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:28.840
Has my chosen one Crest of Glory 
frightened you into submission?

00:20:29.430 --> 00:20:30.790
<i>I knew it...</i>

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:32.580
<i>He's not human at all.</i>

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:34.040
<i>He's a demon!</i>

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:38.250
<i>He's just using a disguise spell 
to hide his true form.</i>

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:41.760
<i>He even has a fake crest 
to let him walk among humans.</i>

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:47.000
The 65th Inter-Academy Competition 
will now commence!

00:20:47.840 --> 00:20:48.850
Begin!

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:51.770
Magic of flame that dwells within me—

00:20:58.470 --> 00:21:01.220
L-Leisis and Giaas are both out!

00:21:02.970 --> 00:21:04.320
Brat!

00:21:04.920 --> 00:21:06.030
Magic of flame that dwells—

00:21:06.030 --> 00:21:07.130
<i>Got him.</i>

00:21:07.130 --> 00:21:09.950
<i>He activated the spell 
before he started his chant!</i>

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:12.910
What? Did he just cast before he—

00:21:10.600 --> 00:21:12.600
Get him, Devilis!

00:21:13.210 --> 00:21:15.230
He did the same with his guard spell...

00:21:15.230 --> 00:21:16.620
What in the world...

00:21:16.620 --> 00:21:19.850
<i>In other words, 
he's just been pretending to chant.</i>

00:21:20.340 --> 00:21:21.300
...arrow!

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:23.330
The demon's head is its weak point!

00:21:25.140 --> 00:21:27.740
Forget your incantation again?

00:21:28.060 --> 00:21:29.550
Come, flame!

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:31.120
<i>That proves it.</i>

00:21:31.120 --> 00:21:34.940
<i>A spell-casting demon, 
pretending to use incantations...</i>

00:21:34.940 --> 00:21:38.560
<i>The demons are the ones 
that brought wordless casting into decline!</i>

00:21:40.240 --> 00:21:44.130
<i>The demons want humans' spells 
as weak as possible.</i>

00:21:44.130 --> 00:21:47.220
<i>They must have infiltrated 
First Academy long ago</i>

00:21:47.220 --> 00:21:51.700
<i>and arranged to have the fourth crest 
declared the Crest of Failure!</i>

00:21:55.270 --> 00:21:56.560
Come, flame!

00:21:57.530 --> 00:21:58.460
How?

00:21:58.460 --> 00:22:00.290
How can you be so strong?!

00:22:00.290 --> 00:22:03.870
Maybe you're just lousy at fighting!

00:22:09.110 --> 00:22:11.450
What's going on?

00:22:12.820 --> 00:22:15.890
D-Did you just use a Spell Shatter?

00:22:16.190 --> 00:22:17.170
Yes.

00:22:17.170 --> 00:22:21.690
And I tacked on a Magic Veil, 
so you wouldn't notice.

00:22:22.080 --> 00:22:24.360
Hey, is that—

00:22:24.360 --> 00:22:26.010
Is Devilis...

00:22:26.010 --> 00:22:27.950
What? What's going on?

00:22:26.820 --> 00:22:27.950
Does that mean...

00:22:27.950 --> 00:22:31.510
A-Are you telling me... 
Devilis is a demon?!

00:22:31.510 --> 00:22:32.950
Contact the palace!

00:22:32.950 --> 00:22:34.660
Evacuate the students at once!

00:22:34.660 --> 00:22:35.990
H-Help!

00:22:35.380 --> 00:22:38.960
Calm down!

00:22:35.990 --> 00:22:37.500
Well, what's your next move?

00:22:38.960 --> 00:22:40.800
Damn you!

00:22:44.810 --> 00:22:47.850
<i>A retreating demon will use 
a Full Flight spell...</i>

00:22:47.850 --> 00:22:51.930
<i>It will take him about 1.5 seconds 
from spreading his wings to takeoff.</i>

00:22:51.930 --> 00:22:53.760
<i>0.8 seconds for my enchantment...</i>

00:22:53.760 --> 00:22:55.650
<i>0.7 seconds remain.</i>

00:22:55.650 --> 00:22:56.970
<i>Easily done!</i>

00:22:58.760 --> 00:23:00.060
<i>Now it's over.</i>

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:07.940
Did he defeat that demon... 
all by himself?

00:23:07.940 --> 00:23:10.950
<i>I can't believe there are demons 
infiltrating the academy.</i>

00:23:12.620 --> 00:23:15.550
<i>I thought I drove them 
to the brink of destruction</i>

00:23:15.550 --> 00:23:18.410
<i>in my old life as Gaius the Sage...</i>

00:23:19.160 --> 00:23:24.320
<i>It seems there are serious problems 
in this day and age.</i>

00:23:25.890 --> 00:23:26.950
Pop quiz, Alma!

00:23:26.950 --> 00:23:28.520
What's the best crest for enchantment?

00:23:28.520 --> 00:23:29.630
Crest of Glory!

00:23:29.630 --> 00:23:30.630
And for power?

00:23:30.630 --> 00:23:31.230
Crest of Standard!

00:23:31.230 --> 00:23:33.860
Now, Matty, say all the crests 
three times fast!

00:23:33.860 --> 00:23:34.510
Eh?!

00:23:34.510 --> 00:23:36.320
Crest of Glory, Crest of Standard, 
Crest of Lesser, Crest of Failure!

00:23:36.320 --> 00:23:38.240
Crest of Glory, Crest of Standard, 
Crest of Lesser, Crest of Failure!

00:23:36.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Episode 2 
The Strongest Stage Enters the Dungeon.</b>

00:23:38.240 --> 00:23:40.320
Crest of Glory, Crest of Standard, 
Crest of Lesser... argh!
